<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S6.SS3.SSS2" title="In 6.3 Prompt Designs for Generation and Evaluation ‣ 6 Supplementary Material ‣ PanoEnv: Exploring 3D Spatial Intelligence in Panoramic Environments with Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.3.2 </span>LLM-as-a-Judge Evaluation Prompts</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
