<td id="S3.T1.5.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding-left:16.0pt;padding-right:16.0pt;">   2,965   </td>
<td id="S3.T1.5.1.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding-left:16.0pt;padding-right:16.0pt;">   20.0%   </td></tr>
